cription":"Tagged multi-fact resolution owned by the comparison compiler path.","properties":{"direction":{"default":"maximum","enum":["maximum","minimum"],"title":"Direction","type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"financial_comparison","default":"financial_comparison","title":"Kind","type":"string"},"operands":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FinancialComparisonOperand"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":2,"title":"Operands","type":"array"},"presentation":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["percent","multiple"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Presentation"},"requested_operators":{"items":{"enum":["argmax","difference","absolute_difference","percent_change","discrete_from_cumulative","concept_ratio","sum"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":2,"minItems":1,"title":"Requested Operators","type":"array"},"verification_claim":{"anyOf":[{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Verification Claim"},"verification_premise_id":{"anyOf":[{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Verification Premise Id"}},"required":["operands"],"title":"FinancialComparisonResolution","type":"object"},"FinancialConcept":{"description":"agent 가 조회할 수 있는 개념. **정본 사전이 아는 것의 부분집합이다.**\n\n여기에 이름을 올리면 ``agent/planning.py`` 의 ``_canonical_account_aliases``\n가 ``src/ingest/account_map.tsv`` 에서 그 개념의 표기를 전부 끌어온다 —\n표면형을 손으로 적지 않는다. 개념마다 회계 축을 ``_CONCEPT_AXES`` 에\n**함께** 올려야 한다. 축이 없으면 기본값(duration·PL)이 붙어 조용히 틀린다.\n\n``non_controlling_interests``·``owners_of_parent`` 은 **자본 잔액만**\n가리킨다 (BS·instant). 예전에는 한 account_norm 에 세 값이 섞여 있어\n등록하지 못했는데, XBRL 요소 ID 가 이미 셋을 가르고 있었다 — 적재의\n``acode_map.tsv`` 에 손익 쪽 코드가 없어 표기 사전으로 흘러 합쳐진 것이다\n(이슈 #127). 이제 넷이 따로 있다.\n\n====================================  ==========  ==================\n개념                                  표          뜻\n====================================  ==========  ==================\nnon_controlling_interests             BS instant  자본 잔액\nnet_income_non_controlling            IS/CI       귀속 당기순이익\ncomprehensive_income_non_controlling  CI          귀속 총포괄손익\nowners_of_parent                      BS instant  자본 잔액\nnet_income_owners_of_parent           IS/CI       귀속 당기순이익\ncomprehensive_income_owners_of_parent CI          귀속 총포괄손익\n====================================  ==========  ==================","enum":["revenue","operating_income","net_income","total_assets","capex_ppe","aoci","cash_and_equivalents","current_assets","current_liabilities","intangible_assets","investment_property","non_current_assets","non_current_liabilities","ppe","retained_earnings","right_of_use_assets","share_capital","share_premium","total_equity","total_liabilities","total_liabilities_and_equity","trade_and_other_receivables","capex_intangible","cf_financing","cf_investing","cf_operating","disposal_intangible","disposal_ppe","dividends_paid","interest_paid","interest_received","net_change_in_cash","cash_beginning","cash_ending","non_controlling_interests","owners_of_parent","net_income_non_controlling","net_income_owners_of_parent","comprehensive_income_non_controlling","comprehensive_income_owners_of_parent","current_tax_assets","current_tax_liabilities","deferred_tax_assets","deferred_tax_liabilities","inventories","provisions","trade_receivables","equity_method_income","finance_costs","finance_income","income_tax","interest_expense","interest_income","other_expenses","other_income","cost_of_sales","diluted_eps","eps","gross_profit","operating_expenses","other_comprehensive_income","pretax_income","sganda","total_comprehensive_income"],"title":"FinancialConcept","type":"string"},"FinancialResolution":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"as_of":{"pattern":"^[0-9]{8}$","title":"As Of","type":"string"},"concept":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FinancialConcept"},"corp_code":{"pattern":"^[0-9]{8}$","title":"Corp Code","type":"string"},"corp_name":{"minLength":1,"title":"Corp Name","type":"string"},"cumulative":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Cumulative"},"kind":{"const":"f